  'german-shepherd':'Created in Germany in the late 19th century by organizing regional herding dogs into a versatile working breed.',
  'alaskan-malamute':'A traditional Arctic sled and hauling dog associated with the Mahlemiut people of Alaska, bred for strength and endurance.',
  'samoyed':'Developed by the Samoyedic peoples of Siberia for herding reindeer, hauling sleds, and sharing close working and family life.',
  'bernese-mountain-dog':'A Swiss farm dog from the canton of Bern, historically used for pulling carts, guarding farms, and moving cattle.',
