  'schnauzer':'Originated in Germany as a farm and stable dog. The Standard Schnauzer is the original size; Miniature and Giant varieties were developed later.',
  'pomeranian':'A small companion Spitz developed from larger northern Spitz dogs in the Pomerania region and refined in Europe.',
  'chihuahua':'Named for the Mexican state of Chihuahua. Its deeper ancestry is debated, with evidence connecting it to earlier Mexican companion dogs.',
